Download the dataset from [PhysioNet](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/physionet-ecg-image-digitization/data) and place it in the `data/` directory:
```
data/
├── train/
│   ├── {sample_id}/
│   │   ├── {sample_id}.csv      # Ground truth signals
│   │   └── {sample_id}-{type}.png  # ECG images
│   └── ...
├── train.csv                     # Metadata
└── train_folds.csv              # Cross-validation splits
```

The data is a subset of the Human Sleep Project dataset on the Brain Data Science Platform

